Dear Ozgun and others,

Regarding plotting, for example of only left sagittal, I have recently updated "plot_brainGraph" to make this very simple. You can still do this via the GUI, but in case you want to programmatically make this work, it will now be quite easy. I will update the User Guide hopefully this weekend to reflect all recent changes.

Chris

